{"id":"n93490-1-7","stage":5,"title":"장유유서 · 长幼有序","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93490-1-7-1","ko":"찬물도 위아래가 있거늘, 너는 장유유서라는 말도 모르냐?","zh":"连喝杯冷水都要讲先后，你不知道长幼有序吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"찬물도","meaning":"冷水，冰水","explanation":"찬물：冷水，冰水；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"찬물","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71464","senseId":"1","lemma":"찬물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찬물도","audio":"/audio/c5e83392a2c737fb00f5.mp3"}},{"text":"위아래가","meaning":"长幼，先后","explanation":"위아래：长幼，先后；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"위아래","audio":"/audio/1b059220de8fda08d177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26750","senseId":"2","lemma":"위아래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위아래가","audio":"/audio/e409015d618da2f782fa.mp3"}},{"text":"있거늘,","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；거늘：较书面或古雅的连接语尾，表示背景、理由或转折。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있거늘","audio":"/audio/fbcce2757b8e82d61ce0.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"장유유서라는","meaning":"长幼有序","explanation":"장유유서：长幼有序；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"장유유서","audio":"/audio/183ed6a397b56418836e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93490","senseId":"1","lemma":"장유유서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장유유서라는","audio":"/audio/efb1dc389766b3832138.mp3"}},{"text":"말도","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI